# tanacloud.com — short links
#
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file. Unlike .htaccess it is a NORMAL filename,
# so nothing can silently drop it on deploy.
#
# CONVENTION (Rohit, 2026-08-02): the tanacloud.com path is the SAME slug Tana
# publishes, so the short link and the destination always agree. To add a
# session: take its tana.pub slug and give it TWO lines below — with and
# without the trailing slash. Cloudflare matches the path LITERALLY, so /x does
# NOT also match /x/, and it is case-sensitive too.
#   /<tana-slug>    https://tana.pub/<nodeId>/<tana-slug>   301
#   /<tana-slug>/   https://tana.pub/<nodeId>/<tana-slug>   301
#
# ⚠️ Do NOT also create a <slug>/index.html page. On Cloudflare Pages a real
#    static file WINS over a redirect rule, so the page would shadow the 301.
#
# 🔒 Every session except the H3 one is password-protected on tana.pub. The
#    password is deliberately NOT in this repo — it is public on GitHub.

